## 4. COMPLETE CALL GRAPH

```
main()
 ├── get_code_nl_separate(input_filepath)
 │    ├── ast.parse(source_text)
 │    ├── _extract_string_nodes(tree, source_lines, nl_spans)
 │    │    ├── _node_name(node)
 │    │    └── _get_assign_target_name(node)
 │    ├── _extract_comment_blocks(source_text)
 │    │    └── _save_comment_block(block_lines, comment_spans)
 │    └── returns (code_only_str, nl_only_str)
 │
 ├── write_to_out_dir_init(code_str, nl_str, input_file)
 │    └── returns sub_dir_path
 │
 └── compress_natural_language_only(sub_dir, nl_filename)
      ├── [imports] compact_tokens__4_19: call_claude, build_compress_prompt, strip_llm_wrapper
      │
      ├── if CALL_OPENAI_API == "Yes":
      │    └── call_opeanAI_compress(nl_text, sub_dir_path)
      │         ├── _get_openai_compress_llm()
      │         │    └── _build_openai_compress_model()  [lazy, once]
      │         ├── _build_openai_compress_prompt(nl_text)
      │         ├── llm.invoke([HumanMessage(content=prompt)])
      │         └── writes result_compress_agent_TIMESTAMP.md → returns path
      │
      └── elif CALL_CLAUDE_API == "Yes":
           ├── build_compress_prompt(nl_text)            [compact_tokens__4_19]
           ├── call_claude(prompt)                       [compact_tokens__4_19]
           │    ├── anthropic SDK  [if ANTHROPIC_API_KEY set]
           │    └── subprocess claude --print  [fallback]
           └── writes <stem>__COMPRESSED__TIMESTAMP.md → returns path
```

