## 5. OUTPUT FILE NAMING CONVENTIONS

| File | Location | Pattern |
|---|---|---|
| Code-only | `dir_out/SUB_DIR_.../` | `<stem>__CODE_ONLY.py` |
| NL-only | `dir_out/SUB_DIR_.../` | `<stem>__NL_ONLY.md` |
| Claude compressed | `dir_out/SUB_DIR_.../` | `<stem>__NL_ONLY__COMPRESSED__<TIMESTAMP>.md` |
| OpenAI compressed | `dir_out/SUB_DIR_.../` | `result_compress_agent_<TIMESTAMP>.md` |
| SUB_DIR itself | `dir_out/` | `SUB_DIR_<stem>__<YYYYMMDD_HHMMSSh>/` |
| Log files | `../proj_root__eval__logs_dir/` | `proj_root__eval__log_<MM_DD_YYYY_HH>00h_.log` |

**Timestamp format:** `YYYYMMDD_HHMMSSh` (e.g., `20260419_192500h`)

