## 6. API TOGGLE MATRIX

| `CALL_CLAUDE_API` | `CALL_OPENAI_API` | Behaviour |
|---|---|---|
| `"No"` | `"Yes"` | **Default** — OpenAI gpt-4o-mini compression; output = `result_compress_agent_TIMESTAMP.md` |
| `"Yes"` | `"No"` | Claude CLI/SDK compression; output = `<stem>__COMPRESSED__TIMESTAMP.md` |
| `"Yes"` | `"Yes"` | OpenAI takes precedence (checked first); Claude branch unreachable |
| `"No"` | `"No"` | Raises `ValueError` — no backend available |

